<p>The <strong>Mysuntown under desk elliptical</strong> is a small, pedal-powered seated elliptical aimed at people who want to stop sitting completely still. You slide it under a desk or in front of a sofa, rest your feet on the pedals and move them in a smooth oval while you work, read or watch TV.</p>
