<p>Reading, video calls with the camera framed above the waist, and audiobooks all pair well with gentle pedaling. Tasks that need close concentration, such as detailed spreadsheets, are easier at a slower pace. Most people find their rhythm within a week. Our guide to the <a href="/portable-elliptical-under-desk/">portable under desk elliptical</a> covers other models built for moving around the house.</p>

